#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:142
msgid "`What is the Reynolds number of the jet exiting the diffusers at the design temperature of 15 degrees Celsius? <https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1lE7cHu3TS1vMs0_yA3FmNdPnk3iktBJw#scrollTo=lwy3sEdObZar&line=2&uniqifier=1>`_"
