msgid "**Answer:** Reynolds number through floc is 938.2 dimensionless. These two Reynold's numbers are similar because conservation of mass requires for a constant length that :math:`\\bar v_{1}*W_{1} = \\bar v_{2}*W_{2}`. The slight difference in the numbers is due to that fact that diffusers are not a continuous line jet but rather broken up by two times the thickness of the pipe wall between the diffusers."
