msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:170
msgid "Calculate the diffuser exit head loss in two ways."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:172
msgid "First, calculate the head loss making sure to account for the upflow velocity in the clarifier."
msgstr ""

